# Links: [[wikilinks]] are underlined in the preview; n selects, Enter follows; the end of a note lists the notes that link to it.
Output assets/readme/feature-links.gif
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape

Type "/"
Sleep 600ms
Type "link to each other"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 1.6s
Type "n"
Sleep 900ms
Type "n"
Sleep 900ms
Type "N"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Type "G"
Sleep 2s

Type "q"
